# Arithmetic on a null operand, against both evaluators -- see
# fixtures/99_null_arith.ds for what each rule rules out.
#
#   r1  every nullable slot null   fires add_is_null, idiv_is_null
#   r2  every slot present         fires add, neg, mul
#
# Separate pumps, so a firing is attributable to its reading.
# @spec [RFCS.6.3]
assert Reading entity_id=r1 state=null qty=null divisor=0
pump
assert Reading entity_id=r2 state=1.0 qty=3 divisor=0
pump
